    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.poster.avif?t=1754075872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.webm?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.mp4?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Background:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young woman trained in martial arts since childhood, she masters swordsmanship, archery, and formidable hand-to-hand combat! For some unknown reason, she finds herself trapped in a fantastical world. To return home, she must fight endlessly. This fantastical world features diverse regions, each with its own unique style\u2014wuxia, xianxia, dark fantasy, and even cyberpunk. She battles different enemies across these varied lands, embracing the thrill of combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/82230796d4815eca09c2cd1afbd1668a.poster.avif?t=1754075872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/82230796d4815eca09c2cd1afbd1668a.webm?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/82230796d4815eca09c2cd1afbd1668a.mp4?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2018Swords &amp; Shadows\u2019 Level Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine faces relentless group battles\u2014swordsmen, shield bearers, archersk, a true swarm combat experience. No polite duels here\uff0cenemies rush in all at once, no holds barred!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch combat styles on the fly: Wield a tachi, switch to arrows, or go bare-handed\uff0cadapt to any threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tachi mastery against crowds:\u00a0Parry to deflect attackers, perfect dodge to counter \u2014 each slash carves a gleaming arc through foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unarmed? No problem! In this world, martial arts unleash &quot;Mountain-Splitting Strikes&quot; and &quot;Heart-Piercing Kicks&quot; \u2014 sending enemies flying in waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget health packs\u2014style equals survival:\u00a0Regain HP by nailing parries, dodges, or executions.\u00a0Build the Rage Gauge(Fire), when full, unleash a screen-clearing ultimate attack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/13d1d209bd8fe8e070138d4583215e41.poster.avif?t=1754075872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/13d1d209bd8fe8e070138d4583215e41.webm?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/13d1d209bd8fe8e070138d4583215e41.mp4?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2018Arrow Rain\u2019 Level Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The female protagonist has four types of bow attacks: normal arrow, charged arrow, rapid-fire arrow, and lightning burst arrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The female protagonist can perform a flying kick to initiate melee attacks without needing to specify the attack direction; the game will automatically target the nearest enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining bow attacks, flying kick melee, and dodging can create spectacular explosive attack effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs each have unique characteristics; some may flank you, some may self-destruct, others might deliver a powerful hammer strike, and on higher difficulties, they can even kill you in one hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious village level features three random weather conditions: clear, thunderstorm, and snowstorm, enhancing the atmospheric experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark Night Warrior, clad in full armor and equipped with a shield, can dodge your arrows, making him a tough opponent. However, he is vulnerable to flying kick attacks. A flying kick from his side or rear can deal significant damage, and the player can regain health and increase firepower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's health regeneration mechanism does not involve picking up health packs. Instead, health is regained by continuously fighting and finding ways to inflict large-scale damage on enemies or by aggressively attacking the boss's weak points, offering high risk but high reward.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3fbe8a87ecae9a10c161840a0c439116.poster.avif?t=1754075872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3fbe8a87ecae9a10c161840a0c439116.webm?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3fbe8a87ecae9a10c161840a0c439116.mp4?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/60cdfba6ab59a4f37281de3756af48dc.poster.avif?t=1754075872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/60cdfba6ab59a4f37281de3756af48dc.webm?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/60cdfba6ab59a4f37281de3756af48dc.mp4?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In future versions, it will:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add more distinctive levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add more impressive NPCs and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue to improve game mechanics and gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm currently working on more NPCs and scenes, hoping to create unique and interesting gameplay. Everyone's suggestions are very important, and I greatly appreciate all the feedback. Thank you all for your comments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why create this game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I originally planned to use the free assets from Unreal Engine to create a game prototype and then develop a game development course. But as the production progressed, I increasingly felt that the limitations of free assets were too much, and began to add some paid assets for creation. Then things got a bit out of hand, so I decided to just go ahead and make a full-fledged game. I will continue to add more content and use more paid assets in the future. Starting production in November 2024, it was completed single-handedly in just a few months. I hope you will like it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QQ Group:</strong>\u00a0979195753</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you are interested in this game and game development, Please subscribe my youtube: @VeryBigFireball</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.poster.avif?t=1754075872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.webm?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.mp4?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Background:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young woman trained in martial arts since childhood, she masters swordsmanship, archery, and formidable hand-to-hand combat! For some unknown reason, she finds herself trapped in a fantastical world. To return home, she must fight endlessly. This fantastical world features diverse regions, each with its own unique style\u2014wuxia, xianxia, dark fantasy, and even cyberpunk. She battles different enemies across these varied lands, embracing the thrill of combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/82230796d4815eca09c2cd1afbd1668a.poster.avif?t=1754075872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/82230796d4815eca09c2cd1afbd1668a.webm?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/82230796d4815eca09c2cd1afbd1668a.mp4?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragra