gonist has four types of bow attacks: normal arrow, charged arrow, rapid-fire arrow, and lightning burst arrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The female protagonist can perform a flying kick to initiate melee attacks without needing to specify the attack direction; the game will automatically target the nearest enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining bow attacks, flying kick melee, and dodging can create spectacular explosive attack effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs each have unique characteristics; some may flank you, some may self-destruct, others might deliver a powerful hammer strike, and on higher difficulties, they can even kill you in one hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious village level features three random weather conditions: clear, thunderstorm, and snowstorm, enhancing the atmospheric experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark Night Warrior, clad in full armor and equipped with a shield, can dodge your arrows, making him a tough opponent. However, he is vulnerable to flying kick attacks. A flying kick from his side or rear can deal significant damage, and the player can regain health and increase firepower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's health regeneration mechanism does not involve picking up health packs. Instead, health is regained by continuously fighting and finding ways to inflict large-scale damage on enemies or by aggressively attacking the boss's weak points, offering high risk but high reward.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3fbe8a87ecae9a10c161840a0c439116.poster.avif?t=1754075872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3fbe8a87ecae9a10c161840a0c439116.webm?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3fbe8a87ecae9a10c161840a0c439116.mp4?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/60cdfba6ab59a4f37281de3756af48dc.poster.avif?t=1754075872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/60cdfba6ab59a4f37281de3756af48dc.webm?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/60cdfba6ab59a4f37281de3756af48dc.mp4?t=1754075872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In future versions, it will:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add more distinctive levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add more impressive NPCs and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue to improve game mechanics and gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm currently working on more NPCs and scenes, hoping to create unique and interesting gameplay. Everyone's suggestions are very important, and I greatly appreciate all the feedback. Thank you all for your comments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why create this game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I originally planned to use the free assets from Unreal Engine to create a game prototype and then develop a game development course. But as the production progressed, I increasingly felt that the limitations of free assets were too much, and began to add some paid assets for creation. Then things got a bit out of hand, so I decided to just go ahead and make a full-fledged game. I will continue to add more content and use more paid assets in the future. Starting production in November 2024, it was completed single-handedly in just a few months. I hope you will like it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QQ Group:</strong>\u00a0979195753</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you are interested in this game and game development, Please subscribe my youtube: @VeryBigFireball</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A girl who has practiced martial arts since childhood finds herself, for some unknown reason, trapped in a fantastical world. She must continuously fight to find her way back home! This is a high-difficulty action game featuring intense combat, immersive scene atmospheres, highly oppressive NPCs.",
